{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8055","id":5228592115,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABN6X78w","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8055","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8055.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8055.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8055","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8055/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8055/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8055/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/3c385e82baa6d59d4d981890ee61e5f06b09e913","number":8055,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(fleet-paperwork): cmd_close refuses to close pull requests (#6900)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #6900 (queue task 14410; triaged/verified in task 11299).\n\n`fleet-paperwork close` could close a pull request: GitHub's issues API returns PRs as issues, and `cmd_close` never checked for a `pull_request` key — a transposed number would close a live PR and the readback would report it as a verified issue close.\n\nChange (`infra/fleet-paperwork/fleet_paperwork.py`): after the initial GET, `cmd_close` now refuses (exit 1, clear message) when the target item carries a `pull_request` key — before any PATCH, and before the already-closed and `--dry-run` branches, so dry-run surfaces the refusal too.\n\nTests (`infra/fleet-paperwork/tests/test_fleet_paperwork.py`, new `TestCmdClosePullRequestGuard`):\n- PR-shaped GET payload is refused, with no PATCH issued and state unchanged\n- PR-shaped payload is also refused under `--dry-run`\n- Issue-shaped payload still closes and verifies\n\nVerification: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` in `infra/fleet-paperwork` — 32 tests, OK; the new guard class also passes standalone (3 tests, OK). `git diff --check` clean.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796838973&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8055&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8055&signature=6ea21c4e402734d1d57a013d03a2bb3fdf51ecc6939113f19d759681881ea730\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8055?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-09T17:56:09Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T18:45:57Z","closed_at":"2026-11-09T18:45:55Z","merged_at":"2026-11-09T18:45:54Z","merge_commit_sha":"c052ccf4ff46ceafcfd09729da45d56efd6e83e9","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"developing-today:queue/14410-6900-close-guard","ref":"queue/14410-6900-close-guard","repo":{"id":627308783,"node_id":"R_kgDOJWP47w","name":"code","full_name":"developing-today/code","owner":{"login":"developing-today","id":26439447,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjI2NDM5NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26439447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":"","language":"Rust","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers